{"steam_appid":4908560,"steam_name":"Setter: Volleyball Manager 27","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4908560/513278477/d3b4903181f480527cd0ad93a7547602b6f1fb9e/1790604947/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1793541724","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257438609/c44e2a252da93ca9afd4891652e03a4a7c28fca6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1793541724","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/841de8f08694d853d14c6b192818f846c07dcca2/ss_841de8f08694d853d14c6b192818f846c07dcca2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794585635","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/446adf8978415f306681a864385ca225bc71106a/ss_446adf8978415f306681a864385ca225bc71106a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794585635","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/fdf702d4b41baa5974958f5ee1487921509f374d/ss_fdf702d4b41baa5974958f5ee1487921509f374d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794585635","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/fe9a9539c5589965c59c31b4a5baae287d86844d/ss_fe9a9539c5589965c59c31b4a5baae287d86844d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794585635","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/e83461001e1fdf812712c706080bd7b9bcd34d7a/ss_e83461001e1fdf812712c706080bd7b9bcd34d7a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794585635"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/99970aff838b7736bf7fec6b73ade9b4.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/16d8d8b2a4f6f8661f0386531928bcb2.poster.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/16d8d8b2a4f6f8661f0386531928bcb2.webm?t=1794585635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/16d8d8b2a4f6f8661f0386531928bcb2.mp4?t=1794585635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge of a men’s volleyball club in <strong>Setter: Volleyball Manager 27</strong>, a single-player management game. <br>Build your squad, shape your tactics and lead your club through every season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/456a642de6d1d1ddd9bf8ad3b1a6572e.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/53705ec4d960c1522d6bc54f16d603e3.poster.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/53705ec4d960c1522d6bc54f16d603e3.webm?t=1794585635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/53705ec4d960c1522d6bc54f16d603e3.mp4?t=1794585635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout talent, negotiate transfers and contracts, and find the right balance of skill and experience. <br>Build a squad that fits your playing style and your budget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/ac99ffbf361ee845fdb04bfa5f285a84.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/df17507069bbccd28880f65a3e9b0651.poster.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/df17507069bbccd28880f65a3e9b0651.webm?t=1794585635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/df17507069bbccd28880f65a3e9b0651.mp4?t=1794585635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study your opponents, exploit their weaknesses and prepare your team to compete. <br>Choose where to apply pressure, how much risk to take and when to change your approach.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/fe99c6ec3b8c0383eb4ae984d5be1618.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/c1e6032cc9508a1c898b5edf6ea1a50a.poster.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/c1e6032cc9508a1c898b5edf6ea1a50a.webm?t=1794585635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/c1e6032cc9508a1c898b5edf6ea1a50a.mp4?t=1794585635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow matches point by point, read the momentum and make tactical changes when they matter most. Take charge yourself or use instant results to keep your career moving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/951be3f8fb6b43c9a20c72fd5ce51eea.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/989e087feda68abf77d169c465427680.poster.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/989e087feda68abf77d169c465427680.webm?t=1794585635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/989e087feda68abf77d169c465427680.mp4?t=1794585635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan training, develop your players and manage your transfer budget and wage bill. <br>Stay on top of club expectations, fixtures and decisions through your calendar and inbox.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/161e3b64a51fa78b0b4a6e07a12b0671.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/ddfaa01198ccd753a2f60d69cf5d58a0.poster.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/ddfaa01198ccd753a2f60d69cf5d58a0.webm?t=1794585635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/ddfaa01198ccd753a2f60d69cf5d58a0.mp4?t=1794585635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop young talent, replace key players and keep your squad competitive as seasons unfold. <br>Chase domestic titles and European success while building for the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/3ef672de524f0ce270df5b1349835235.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/3bb5ad972213ed2a303c760db000e7f3.poster.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/3bb5ad972213ed2a303c760db000e7f3.webm?t=1794585635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/3bb5ad972213ed2a303c760db000e7f3.mp4?t=1794585635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in the included volleyball world, create a fictional setting or bring in your own competition data. <br>Choose your club and start writing its next chapter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4908560/extras/83cd09b1cc59359b00bf5e57e8c563ce.avif?t=1794585635\" width=1170 height=110 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3 (dual-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 5 (quad-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Simulation","Sports","Strategy"],"developers":["Setter"],"publishers":["Setter"],"release_date":"Nov 13, 2026"}